  unitName: Slicing Bolt Raiden
  unitId: 40223
  unitNumber: 586
  description: The powerful chief of a bandit clan in the Atharva Republic. Captured
    by Falma and Grafl, he was initially sentenced to life in prison until the war
    against the gods broke out. He was given the chance to fight in the civilian
    army in order to earn back his freedom. Apparently, having enjoyed fighting the
    gods so much, there are no accounts which state that he committed any crimes
    during this time. However, having chosen Eze as his rival, it is said that he
    unsuccessfully tried to take the Thunder Sword Batootha from him on numerous
    occasions.
  summonDesc: Gahahaha! <br>Supreme leader of the slicing thunder, Raiden has arrived!<br>
    Hey, act a bit more scared!
  fusionDesc: You're doing that again<br>to make me work hard for you? <br> Not interested!
  evoDesc: What do you think?<br> Cool mask, right?<br>I wanna see you guys cower
    right now!
